---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" description="Resume of Galaxy Kadiyala — Technical Program Manager with 15+ years in cloud, infrastructure, and platform engineering.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="resume-header">
        <div>
          <h1>Galaxy Kadiyala</h1>
          <p class="resume-tagline">Technical Program Manager · Bengaluru, India · <a href="mailto:igalaxyk@gmail.com">igalaxyk@gmail.com</a> · <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/galaxyk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tagline-link">in/galaxyk</a> · <a href="https://github.com/galaxykadiyala" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tagline-link">/galaxykadiyala</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-header-actions">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn outline">Contact →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="resume-body">

        <!-- Summary -->
        <div class="resume-section">
          <div class="resume-section-label">Summary</div>
          <div class="resume-section-content">
            <p>
              Technical Program Manager with 15+ years delivering platform and infrastructure programs across globally distributed teams, with hands-on experience building AI/LLM-powered tools. Currently owning UI release readiness at Rubrik as the final release gate. Previously delivered a 10-month test automation and release qualification program at Everpure (Portworx). 6+ years at Nutanix as Engineering Manager and Senior MTS. Co-inventor on two US patents in distributed systems. Strong in release governance, dependency management, and execution visibility at scale.

            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Experience -->
        <div class="resume-section">
          <div class="resume-section-label">Experience</div>
          <div class="resume-section-content">

            <div class="resume-item">
              <div class="resume-item-header">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="resume-item-title">Technical Program Manager</h3>
                  <span class="resume-item-org">Aziro Technologies · Bengaluru</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">Oct 2024 – Present</span>
              </div>
              <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; opacity: 0.6; font-family: var(--mono); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.5;">Deputed to client engagements; currently embedded at Rubrik after delivering a 10-month engagement at Everpure (Portworx).</p>
              <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.85;">At Rubrik — UI Release Readiness (Current)</p>
              <ul class="resume-item-bullets" style="margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
                <li>Own UI release readiness as the final release gate for weekly UI releases and additional product-specific release trains across the week.</li>
                <li>Coordinate two QA teams (manual and automation), driving blocker-bug clearance, bug verification, and release sign-off.</li>
                <li>Manage risks and dependencies across feature, QA, and engineering teams to keep release commitments on track.</li>
                <li>Deliver weekly leadership updates and prepare quality dashboards and release reports for executive reviews.</li>
              </ul>
              <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.85;">At Everpure (Portworx) — Test Automation &amp; Release Qualification Program (10 months, completed)</p>
              <ul class="resume-item-bullets">
                <li>Led a 10-month program to automate Portworx's release qualification backlog, coordinating 7 engineering teams (2 UI, 5 backend) across globally distributed locations.</li>
                <li>Owned program execution end-to-end: project initialization, scoping, sprint planning, team assignments, weekly executive reviews, retrospectives, and cross-team dependency management via Jira and Confluence.</li>
                <li>Drove automation of 1,500 UI, functional, and system test cases across multiple Portworx products (UI in Cypress/TypeScript, backend in Go).</li>
                <li>Built and rolled out a CI/CD pipeline to run the automated suite, reducing release qualification cycle from 1–2 weeks (manual) to 1–2 days.</li>
                <li>Ran training sessions, tracked bugs and issues, and unblocked cross-team risks to keep program velocity on track.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="resume-item">
              <div class="resume-item-header">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="resume-item-title">Engineering Manager / Technical Program Manager</h3>
                  <span class="resume-item-org">Nutanix</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">Feb 2021 – Feb 2024</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="resume-item-bullets">
                <li>Directed cross-functional programs supporting Nutanix's enterprise-scale infrastructure platform, used by 10,000+ customers worldwide.</li>
                <li>Drove multi-year cross-functional initiatives to adopt phased CI/CD, improving platform reliability by 30%.</li>
                <li>Managed program execution including roadmap alignment, release governance, triage, RCA, and risk management.</li>
                <li>Automated operational workflows resulting in 500+ engineering hours saved annually.</li>
                <li>Developed leadership dashboards improving delivery predictability and release transparency.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="resume-item">
              <div class="resume-item-header">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="resume-item-title">Senior Member of Technical Staff</h3>
                  <span class="resume-item-org">Nutanix</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">Nov 2017 – Jan 2021</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="resume-item-bullets">
                <li>Led QA strategy for Lifecycle Management and Disaster Recovery components across AHV (KVM) and ESXi.</li>
                <li>Validated DR workflows including snapshot integrity, replication, and failover.</li>
                <li>Built nested cluster model reducing build cycle time from 4 hours to 30 minutes.</li>
                <li>Co-invented two US-patented systems (HA File Servers, Snapshot Integrity) now shipping in Nutanix products.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="resume-item">
              <div class="resume-item-header">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="resume-item-title">Technical Lead</h3>
                  <span class="resume-item-org">Terralogic</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">Dec 2011 – Oct 2017</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="resume-item-bullets">
                <li>Managed QA for Nutanix and Cisco product lines, focusing on automation, reliability, and network protocol testing.</li>
                <li>Led test strategy and execution for system and regression testing across enterprise networking products.</li>
                <li>Mentored engineers across multiple test pods over a 6-year tenure, scaling team practices and tooling.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Skills -->
        <div class="resume-section">
          <div class="resume-section-label">Skills</div>
          <div class="resume-section-content">
            <div class="skills-grid">
              <div class="skill-group">
                <h4 class="skill-group-title">Program Management</h4>
                <ul class="skill-list">
                  <li>Roadmapping</li>
                  <li>Release planning</li>
                  <li>Dependency mapping</li>
                  <li>Program governance</li>
                  <li>Metrics &amp; dashboards</li>
                  <li>Stakeholder management</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="skill-group">
                <h4 class="skill-group-title">Tools &amp; Platforms</h4>
                <ul class="skill-list">
                  <li>Jira · Confluence</li>
                  <li>Git / GitHub</li>
                  <li>Jenkins · CI/CD pipelines</li>
                  <li>Selenium</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="skill-group">
                <h4 class="skill-group-title">Cloud &amp; Infrastructure</h4>
                <ul class="skill-list">
                  <li>Kubernetes · AWS · Linux</li>
                  <li>Microservices architecture</li>
                  <li>Distributed systems</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="skill-group">
                <h4 class="skill-group-title">Technical &amp; AI</h4>
                <ul class="skill-list">
                  <li>Python · Bash</li>
                  <li>API debugging</li>
                  <li>Test automation</li>
                  <li>Claude Code · Codex</li>
                  <li>Built tools on LLM APIs (Anthropic, OpenAI)</li>
                  <li>RAG architectures</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Patents -->
        <div class="resume-section">
          <div class="resume-section-label">Patents</div>
          <div class="resume-section-content">
            <div class="community-list">
              <div class="community-item">
                <div>
                  <a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US11770447B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="patent-link"><strong>Managing HA File Servers</strong></a>
                  <span class="community-location">US 11,770,447 B2</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">2023</span>
              </div>
              <div class="community-item">
                <div>
                  <a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US11455277B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="patent-link"><strong>Verifying Snapshot Integrity</strong></a>
                  <span class="community-location">US 11,455,277 B2</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">2022</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Certifications -->
        <div class="resume-section">
          <div class="resume-section-label">Certifications</div>
          <div class="resume-section-content">
            <div class="community-list">
              <div class="community-item">
                <div>
                  <a href="https://www.credly.com/org/scaled-agile/badge/certified-safe-6-agilist" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="patent-link"><strong>Certified SAFe® 6 Agilist</strong></a>
                  <span class="community-location">Scaled Agile, Inc.</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">2025</span>
              </div>
              <div class="community-item">
                <div>
                  <strong>Nutanix Certified Professional – Multicloud Infrastructure (NCP-MCI)</strong>
                  <span class="community-location">Nutanix</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">2022</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Education -->
        <div class="resume-section">
          <div class="resume-section-label">Education</div>
          <div class="resume-section-content">
            <div class="community-list">
              <div class="community-item">
                <div>
                  <strong>PGCP, Strategic Product Management</strong>
                  <span class="community-location">Indian Institute of Management, Visakhapatnam</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">2025</span>
              </div>
              <div class="community-item">
                <div>
                  <strong>M.Tech, Networking &amp; Telecommunications</strong>
                  <span class="community-location">International Institute of Information Technology, Pune</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">2011</span>
              </div>
              <div class="community-item">
                <div>
                  <strong>B.Tech, Information Technology</strong>
                  <span class="community-location">JNTU, Hyderabad</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">2009</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Volunteer -->
        <div class="resume-section">
          <div class="resume-section-label">Volunteer</div>
          <div class="resume-section-content">
            <div class="resume-item">
              <div class="resume-item-header">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="resume-item-title">Volunteer</h3>
                  <span class="resume-item-org">Mozilla Foundation</span>
                </div>
                <span class="tag coral">Jun 2010 – Present</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="resume-item-bullets">
                <li>Led Mozilla's Firefox Student Ambassador program in India, promoting open web standards and digital literacy across student communities.</li>
                <li>Spearheaded outreach and contributor campaigns that engaged 10,000+ students and early tech adopters across Asia.</li>
                <li>Represented Mozilla at national and international conferences, mentored new contributors, and scaled regional Mozilla community chapters.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.resume-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
  padding-bottom: 2rem;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
}
.resume-header h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
.resume-tagline {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  opacity: 0.5;
}
.resume-header-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-shrink: 0; }

.tagline-link {
  color: var(--accent-4);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 2px;
}
.tagline-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }

.patent-link {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
}
.patent-link strong {
  border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--accent-4);
  transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
}
.patent-link:hover strong { color: var(--accent); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }

.resume-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

.resume-section {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
  gap: 2rem;
  align-items: start;
  padding: 2.5rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.resume-section-content {
  min-width: 0;
}

.resume-section-label {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  opacity: 0.4;
  padding-top: 0.25rem;
  position: sticky;
  top: 80px;
  align-self: start;
}

.resume-section-content p {
  font-size: 1.02rem;
  opacity: 0.75;
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.resume-item { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
.resume-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

.resume-item-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.resume-item-title {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
}

.resume-item-org {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  opacity: 0.75;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.resume-item-bullets {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.45rem;
}
.resume-item-bullets li {
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 0.93rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  opacity: 0.7;
  padding-left: 1.2rem;
  position: relative;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.resume-item-bullets li::before {
  content: '→';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  opacity: 0.4;
}

.skills-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 2rem;
}

.skill-group-title {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  opacity: 0.5;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  padding-bottom: 6px;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
}

.skill-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
}
.skill-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--ink);
  opacity: 0.72;
  line-height: 1.5;
  padding: 2px 0;
}
.skill-list li::before {
  content: '';
  display: inline-block;
  width: 3px;
  height: 3px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--accent);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.community-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

.community-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 0.9rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.community-item strong {
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
}
.community-location {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  opacity: 0.7;
  color: var(--ink);
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .resume-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  .resume-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .skills-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .resume-item-header { flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>
